WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.920
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.200
Link Summon!

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.390
Appear, Link 3 Gouki Thunder Ogre!

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.890
The Equip Spell, Gouki Dark Mask!

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.000
I equip it on Thunder Ogre!

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:29.340
And I make a heel turn!

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.550
My name is now Dark Onizuka!

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.180
You’re finally up!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.520
Link Summon!

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.810
The strongest DNA combines into this monster!

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:49.020
Link 2 Helixx Necro Darwin!

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.600
Are you going?

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:20.700
I run Across the universe

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.870
At the speed of light

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.740
Begin Loading

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:29.480
Open the door of dreams

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.050
VRAINS spreads

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:36.150
Believe in myself

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:39.690
VRAINS continues

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:45.000
The circuit draws the future

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:49.070
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:50.670
Access!

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:53.370
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.970
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:57.270
Link with my soul

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:00.040
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:01.780
Now Win the Race

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:04.620
Connected world

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:08.120
No matter when

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.490
Nothing is impossible

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:15.600
Strive for hope

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:20.200
And ride the wind!

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:55.460
You’re tough.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.080
Go...

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:14.260
You may have used Gouki Octostretch’s 
effect to survive, but I won't let up.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.640
Necro Darwin’s effect from my graveyard!

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:19.620
This damage can't stop me.

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:24.170
It’s Special Summoned next 
to Gothiclone’s link!

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:31.120
When a Link Monster is Special Summoned 
from the graveyard, my Skill activates!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:32.650
Preserve Species!

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:37.800
Your monster’s ATK and your LP are halved!

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:40.970
What?

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:45.740
Dark Thunder Ogre’s ATK is halved to 1700?

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:08.000
Onizuka only has 100 LP left!

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:10.960
Hurry, Yusaku.  Or else…

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.480
I end my turn.

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:24.360
However…

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:28.990
Just give up.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:35.060
AI, tell your master about his situation.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:38.060
You can do that, right?

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:42.020
When Necro Darwin is mutually linked...

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:47.760
...its effect won't let it be targeted for 
attack, so all attacks go towards Gothiclone.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:53.440
Gothiclone can’t be destroyed in battle, 
and its effect makes its ATK equal to yours.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:57.860
And by tributing a linked 
monster, you take effect damage.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:00.480
A perfect battle formation.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:05.440
You’re cornered in both 
offense and defense.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.190
Admit defeat.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:12.630
The wind?

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:17.480
You want to know my identity 
that badly, Dr. Genome?

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.560
It’s Playmaker!

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:28.560
Our hero has arrived!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.660
Defeat the Knight of Hanoi!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.480
You made it in time, Yusaku.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:35.450
I was waiting for you, Playmaker!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.460
And Ignis!

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:38.050
Humph!

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:43.430
I have a cool name!  It's Ai, you DNA lover!

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:47.500
He surprisingly loves his name.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:50.360
He named you?

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:54.750
You’ve been domesticated, like a pet.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:55.880
Not true!  Woof!

00:05:55.880 --> 00:06:00.330
Playmaker, you're here 
to rescue Dark Onizuka?

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:03.810
Don’t get the wrong idea.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:09.510
You said you'll decide 
your own destiny and duel.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.520
So I came to laugh at you when you lose.

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:17.000
Say what!

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:23.920
Dr. Genome, you said there are limits to DNA.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:27.670
But I believe in humanity’s potential.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:30.670
You’re lecturing me?

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:35.370
I was able to create this because 
I know the limits of DNA.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:39.520
I will annihilate the Ignis 
- the AI with free will.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:46.120
I'll combine and evolve its DNA 
to create the most powerful being!

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.740
Remember this:

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:52.860
As long as people have strong 
will, they can evolve further.

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:55.860
And surpass your dueling!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:58.800
That's what makes a true duelist!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.210
Playmaker...

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:05.480
The duel isn’t over yet!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.740
Watch me evolve!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.890
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:19.720
Blow harder, my wind!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:30.010
Whoa!  What’s going on?

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:36.140
Dark Onizuka’s mask, symbolizing 
his heel status, is breaking apart!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:46.580
Facing his demise, Dark Onizuka 
evolves into a new Go Onizuka!

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:50.340
I activate the spell card, Gouki Face Turn!

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:53.320
This card destroys one Gouki card.

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:57.520
I destroy Gouki Dark Mask!

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:01.760
You destroyed your own card?

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:04.740
My evolution is only getting started!

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:08.970
I Special Summon a Gouki from my graveyard!

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:19.180
This is how my dueling evolved!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.650
Appear!  My circuit!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:27.130
Whoa!  He's Link Summoning!

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:30.270
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Goukis!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:37.450
I set Link 3 Gouki Thunder Ogre and 
Gouki Suprex in the Link Markers!

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.340
Link Summon!

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:50.290
Appear, Link 4 Gouki The Master Ogre!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.260
Link 4?

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:57.080
Link 4 Gouki The Master Ogre has appeared!

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.060
But the situation hasn’t changed.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:04.460
Actually, my fierce evolution 
is only getting started!

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.790
Gouki Suprex went to the graveyard, 
so its effect activates!

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:11.670
I add a Gouki from my deck to my hand.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:15.310
I activate the spell card, Gouki Re-Match!

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:20.780
I Special Summon two Goukis with different 
Levels from my graveyard in defense position!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:25.490
Resurrect, Twistcobra and Riscorpio!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.400
Gouki The Master Ogre’s effect activates!

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:38.140
Once per turn, all Goukis next 
to its links return to my hand.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.050
For every monster I return,

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:43.990
I negate the effects  of one of your
 monsters until the end of the turn.

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:59.280
Gothiclone and Necro Darwin’s 
effects are negated!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:09:59.980
Yeah.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:05.980
The Master Ogre must attack the 
monster with the highest ATK first.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:10.190
But it can attack all your monsters!

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:13.420
First, attack Necro Darwin!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.660
This is the end!

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:28.330
The Master Ogre!

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:32.050
Go!  Attack Gothiclone!

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:53.360
Go!

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:55.950
Go Onizuka did it!

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:59.990
He's back on the scene 
by defeating Dr. Genome!

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:01.910
Nice, Go Onizuka!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:02.820
He did it!

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:05.820
Nice dueling, Go.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.330
Now Makoto will be…

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.930
I'm taking the virus removal 
program, as promised.

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:26.760
Good guy to heel, heel to good guy.

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.170
You call that evolving?

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:33.440
I make the evolution process entertaining.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:38.140
That’s why I’m the world’s 
#1 entertainer - Go Onizuka!

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:44.150
You'll regret defeating me.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.860
Now Makoto will be saved.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.540
Playmaker.

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:06.620
You said you came to laugh at me.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:10.490
But that was a lie to motivate me.

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:11.820
Am I wrong?

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:13.750
Who knows.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.750
I will defeat you someday!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:20.500
But the Knights of Hanoi 
are destroying LINK VRAINS!

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.200
I'll crush them first!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:26.840
Feel free to join me.

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:27.670
Right.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.660
What about you, Blue Angel?

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.860
Cracking Dragon attacks you directly!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.640
Direct attack!

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:14.070
Finish her!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.580
Who’s next?

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:23.220
We’ll turn you all into Anothers!

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:24.850
Damn!

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:28.430
Hanoi are doing whatever they like!

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:32.380
Can we let them run amok?

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:38.060
Since LINK VRAINS is in trouble, 
the Duel Club should take action!

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.870
Right, Zaizen?

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.830
President!

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:44.100
We should take action?

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:49.050
You want us to go to LINK VRAINS 
and duel against the Hanoi?

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.070
Well…

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:54.300
I'm going!  I can’t stay on the sidelines-

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.050
No!

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:58.050
It's too dangerous.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:05.470
If you or anyone in this club get turned 
into Anothers, I’ll regret it forever.

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:11.220
The Duel Club is suspended until 
the Another problem is resolved.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:14.250
Wait a second, President!

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:15.720
Be quiet.

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:26.920
Gouki The Master Ogre attacks Jack Wyvern!

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:39.420
Nice, Onizuka!

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.970
I can’t stay on the sidelines!

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:43.740
What are you doing?

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:47.620
I’ll also defeat the 
Hanoi and become famous!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:48.120
H-Hey!

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.360
They're really here!

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:09.460
This place is dangerous.  Go home.

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:11.440
Playmaker...

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:15.180
You should do what he says.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:16.160
Okay.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.180
I’ll take you on.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.140
As I hoped!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.100
That was fast.

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.820
That was scary.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.560
Playmaker has arrived!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.560
Then there's nothing to worry about.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:39.980
Let Playmaker handle 
this.  Meeting adjourned.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:43.000
We'll meet again when there’s peace.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:43.970
See you!

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:46.430
Nice, Playmaker!

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:49.430
Defeat the Knights of Hanoi!

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:52.500
Go go go!  Yeah!

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:03.420
Hand over the computer virus removal program.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:06.600
No one gave us that.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:09.080
Then who has it?

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.330
If you don’t tell me, I’ll eat you!

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.280
It’s…

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.260
Erase.

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:25.110
To stop him from talking.

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:26.460
So cruel.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.620
Playmaker!

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:30.580
Have you seen Blue Angel?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:31.910
No.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:35.350
So it’s just the two of us.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.120
She's not coming back.

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:49.120
Whether Blue Angel fights against the Hanoi 
or not, this situation won’t change.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.250
Why?

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:53.820
#1: Even if we keep fighting, 
there’s no end to them.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:59.290
#2: The computer virus is constantly 
updated, so we can’t make a removal program.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:05.270
#3: We can only solve this by finding the 
person who created the computer virus.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:09.350
We have to get to the source.

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:23.340
Isn’t it nice?  Since your brother 
was demoted, he can come home early.

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:26.830
You didn't need to say "demoted."

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:32.140
I’ve always made you feel lonely.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:35.880
But from now on, I can be more by your side.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:40.200
You don’t like that?

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.860
That's not true.

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.320
I’m happy that you can come home early.

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:51.280
We interrupt this program for SOL 
Technologies' press conference.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:18:01.540
It took a long time, but SOL Technologies 
has successfully developed a 100% AI duelist.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:03.960
I’ll now make a promise!

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:11.000
Our AI department will eliminate the Knights 
of Hanoi and restore peace to LINK VRAINS!

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:15.380
So he's the Security Manager 
who replaced Zaizen.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.460
He’s quite confident.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.980
But this allows us to buy time.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:27.720
Even if it loses, a 100% AI 
can't be turned into Another.

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:30.720
But that's not the same for you.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:35.440
Don’t go to LINK VRAINS.  I'm serious.

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:42.360
If Aoi experienced what you did...

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:45.580
If a stranger kidnapped her...

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:51.120
My spirit would've broken.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:53.590
Promise me.

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:57.050
Yes, brother.

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:59.510
Chain switch complete!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:00.930
Activation confirmed!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.800
Skill set!  Triple Draw!

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:04.830
Duel Level MAX!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.260
Limiter removed!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:12.240
It's finally the day I inscribe 
my name in AI history.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.200
Standby OK!  Ready to go!

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:22.220
My promotion is 100% guaranteed!

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:27.610
Dispatch AI Duelist Squad!

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:47.390

(Note: Historical Japanese battles)

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:47.390
Is this a modern Battle of 
Okehazama or Sekigahara?

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:52.840
Now begins a huge duel to decide 
the fate of LINK VRAINS!

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:57.280
Wow!  This fight has a thousand duelists!

00:19:57.810 --> 00:20:03.250
We'd love to watch, but we're busy.

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:09.250
Now's our chance to find a 
lead on the virus's creator.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.230
Easy for you to say.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.230
I'll switch the main monitor to the map.

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.850
Who will win?

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:25.240
SOL Technologies?  Or the Knights of Hanoi?

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:30.840
No. 266 won!  No. 45 won!

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:32.520
No. 13 won!

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:35.750
No. 702 won!  No. 444 won!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.290
No. 267 won!

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:41.500
30% of the Knights of 
Hanoi have been defeated!

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:44.260
Good!  Keep it up and defeat them all!

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:49.180
What?

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.280
No. 39 lost!

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:54.570
No. 580 lost!  No. 933 lost!

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:56.040
No. 80 lost!

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:59.450
No. 163 lost!  No. 895 lost!

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:02.910
What’s going on?

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:08.140
Two Knights of Hanoi are 
winning at incredible speed!

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:09.310
Two?

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:10.680
I’ll put it on screen!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.830
Them?

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:21.880
The AI Squad have all lost.

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:27.340
0% chance of my promotion...

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.720
You’re going to work now?

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.540
Yeah.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:39.290
I doubt I can do anything, but I’m going.

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:41.150
Bye.

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:48.780
What about you, Blue Angel?

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:53.000
Don’t go to LINK VRAINS.  I'm serious.

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:01.530
I…

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:27.040
Dance!  Strike with your heels

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:30.550
Scream!  You Gotta Go  Raise your voice

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:34.180
Sing!  Unleash your existence

00:22:34.470 --> 00:22:38.220
Get Away!  Until you surpass your limits

00:22:40.110 --> 00:22:42.110
Try It over and over

00:22:43.850 --> 00:22:50.270
In this world that spreads forever

00:22:50.620 --> 00:22:57.210
The timeline flows forever

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.770
Nothing is certain

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:01.450
In these isolated times

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:03.210
Set Yourself Free without hesitation

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:04.980
Cuz We Still Believin' Magic

00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:08.370
The traces we leave behind

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:11.940
The traces we leave behind

